is_a: GO:0005681 ! spliceosomal complex
is_a: GO:1902494 ! catalytic complex

[Term]
id: GO:0071014
name: post-mRNA release spliceosomal complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A spliceosomal complex that is formed following the release of the spliced product from the post-spliceosomal complex and contains the excised intron and three snRNPs, including U5." [GOC:ab, GOC:krc, GOC:mah, ISBN:0879695897, ISBN:0879697393, PMID:19239890]
