namespace: biological_process
def: "The process in which the anatomical structures of a metanephric mesenchymal tissue are generated and organized. Metanephric mesenchyme is the tissue made up of loosely connected mesenchymal cells in the metanephros." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
is_a: GO:0072131 ! kidney mesenchyme morphogenesis
relationship: part_of GO:0072075 ! metanephric mesenchyme development

[Term]
