name: nephrogenic mesenchyme morphogenesis
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process in which the anatomical structures of a nephrogenic mesenchymal tissue are generated and organized. Nephrogenic mesenchyme is the tissue made up of loosely connected mesenchymal cells in the nephron." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
is_a: GO:0072131 ! kidney mesenchyme morphogenesis
relationship: part_of GO:0072076 ! nephrogenic mesenchyme development

