comment: In Field and Osbourn 2008 (PMID:18356490), thalianol is referred to as (3S,13S,3R)-malabarica-8,17,21-trien-3-ol and thalian-diol is referred to as (3S,13S,14R)-malabarica-8,17,21-trien-3,?-diol, but the error in this naming system was pointed out in Kolesnikova 2007 (PMID:17474751). The new names used in the definition have been approved by the authors (Field and Osbourn 2008).
