[Term]
id: GO:0110142
name: ubiquinone biosynthesis complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "The cytosolic ubiquinone biosynthesis complex is composed of enzymes and accessory factors of the ubiquinone biosynthesis pathway and enables synthesis of the extremely hydrophobic molecule ubiquinone. In E. coli, the complex is composed of seven proteins: UbiE, F, G, H, I, J and K." [GOC:imk, PMID:27060254, PMID:28927698, PMID:30686758]
