[Term]
id: GO:0140581
name: P-type monovalent copper transporter activity
namespace: molecular_function
def: "Enables the transfer of a solute or solutes from one side of a membrane to the other according to the reaction: ATP + H2O + Cu+(in) -> ADP + phosphate + Cu+(out)." [RHEA:25792]
comment: Note that this enzyme transports Cu(+) or Ag(+), and cannot transport the divalent ions, contrary to EC:7.2.2.9, which mainly transports the divalent copper ion (source: EC:7.2.2.8).
