[Term]
id: GO:1905556
name: ciliary vesicle assembly
namespace: biological_process
def: "The aggregation, arrangement and bonding together of a set of components to form a ciliary vesicle. Multiple smaller vesicles dock to the transitional fibers on a mature basal body and then fuse together to form a larger single vesicle. This then fuses with the plasma membrane and forms the ciliary membrane." [GO_REF:0000079, GOC:cilia, GOC:TermGenie, PMID:13978319, PMID:25313408, PMID:25805133, PMID:25812525]
