[Term]
id: GO:1990070
name: TRAPPI protein complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A complex that tethers COPII vesicles at ER-Golgi intermediate compartment. Its role in this part of the vesicular transport may start at the ER exit sites. Binds to a component of the COPII coat. In yeast it includes the following subunits: Bet3 (as homodimer), Bet5, Trs20, Trs23, Trs31, Trs33 which are regarded as the core subunits of all TRAPP complexes in yeast." [GOC:bhm, PMID:20375281, PMID:22669257]
