is_a: GO:0061687 ! detoxification of inorganic compound
relationship: part_of GO:0010039 ! response to iron ion

[Term]
id: GO:1990462
name: omegasome
namespace: cellular_component
def: "Omega-shaped (as in the Greek capital letter) intracellular membrane-bounded organelle enriched in phosphatidylinositol 3-phosphate and dynamically connected to the endoplasmic reticulum. Omegasomes are the first step of the formation of autophagosomes via the phagophore assembly sites." [GOC:autophagy, GOC:mf, PMID:18725538, PMID:24591649]
