comment: (R)-lactate, (R)-malate and meso-tartrate are good substrates. Ubiquinone-1 and the dye 2,6-dichloroindophenol can act as acceptors; NAD+ and NADP+ are not acceptors.
synonym: "(R)-2-hydroxy acid dehydrogenase activity" RELATED [EC:1.1.5.10]
