[Term]
id: GO:1990705
name: cholangiocyte proliferation
namespace: biological_process
def: "The multiplication or reproduction of cholangiocytes, resulting in the expansion of the cholangiocyte population. A cholangiocyte is an epithelial cell that is part of the bile duct. Cholangiocytes contribute to bile secretion via net release of bicarbonate and water." [PMID:24434010]
synonym: "hepatoblast proliferation" EXACT []
is_a: GO:0050673 ! epithelial cell proliferation

[Term]
id: GO:1990706
