[Term]
id: GO:1990722
name: DAPK1-calmodulin complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A serine/threonine protein kinase complex involved in cell survival, apoptosis and autophagic cell death pathways. DAPK1 is activated by the dephosphorylation of a n-terminal serine and calcium-calmodulin binding." [GOC:bhm, PMID:20103772]
