[Term]
id: GO:2000046
name: obsolete regulation of G2 phase of mitotic cell cycle
namespace: biological_process
def: "OBSOLETE. Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of G2 phase of mitotic cell cycle." [GOC:mtg_cell_cycle, GOC:vw]
comment: This term was made obsolete because we felt that phases themselves are not being regulated, it's rather the transitions between phases. If you are trying to make an annotation to x phase, it is likely that the correct process is 'regulation of x/y phase transiition.
